            -- spoofed the RETURNED Result. Server sees Aim~=Result and
            -- rejects it: beam on your screen only, no damage, invisible to
            -- others. Correct approach: snap P.AimPosition onto the head
            -- Fan dial: spread size 0 = exact-center laser (always damages);
